# Text files are stored with LF and checked out as-is.
#
# The Colony repository commits CRLF for historical reasons; this one does not,
# and being explicit here stops a future `core.autocrlf=true` on somebody's
# machine from rewriting every file in a single noisy commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
